Greetings!

I have started working on my academic project which is on object based image
classification using Geostatistics of landsat data. My objective is to
analyze increase in cropped area over years. I will be using GRASS and R to
accomplish my objectives. I am interested to know if anyone is aware of such
work carried out in past using GRASS and R. Such a study if available would
serve as a benchmark for my work.

Regards,

Chethan S.

